  "type": "Manifest",
  "label": {
    "en": [
      "This postcard features an illustration of a traditional hiking boot, with the sole partly cut away to reveal a picturesque view of a hilly cityscape. The view includes a river, a bridge, several buildings, a church, and what appears to be a fortress or castle on top of the hill. In the top left corner, the text 'Bergheil aus Graz.' is printed, indicating greetings from Graz."
    ]
  },
